<li>Burhan (1902-1944)</li>
<li>Batin Pengikhan Syarfuddin (1945 – 1950)</li>
<li>Arisam (1951 – 1956)</li>
<li>Arifin Abu (1956 - 1957)</li>
<li>Syamsuddin (1958 - 1963)</li>
<li>Jahari (1964 – 1973)</li>
